            </Buff>
          </Helmet>
          <Necklace>
            <Name>Beholder Optic Nerves</Name>
            <Icon>Necklace_1</Icon>
            <Description>This necklace is fashioned from the optic nerves of a beholder. Wearing this
necklace grants increased visual acuity. The optic nerves can also absorb a
limited amount of aberrant beholder energy. The necklace will absorb any spell
like effects cast by beholders for a limited time. After absorbing a limited
number of spells some time is required to bleed off the energy before the necklace
can once again perform this warding function.</Description>
            <DropLocation>Invaders!, end chest (only if Boktar is the end boss)</DropLocation>
            <MinLevel>7</MinLevel>
            <EquipmentSlot>
              <Necklace/>
            </EquipmentSlot>
            <Material>Gold</Material>
            <Buff>
              <Type>SkillBonus</Type>
              <Value1>7</Value1>
              <BonusType>Competence</BonusType>
              <Item>Search</Item>
            </Buff>
            <Buff>
              <Type>SkillBonus</Type>
              <Value1>7</Value1>
              <BonusType>Competence</BonusType>
              <Item>Spot</Item>
            </Buff>
          </Necklace>
          <Trinket>
            <Name>Globe of Imperial Blood (historic)</Name>
            <Icon>Trinket_75</Icon>
            <Description>A fist-sized globule of bright-red blood, suspended in a crystalline sphere.
It is thought that such globes were used by the giants to prove imperial descent,
but the secret of the test is now forgotten.</Description>
            <DropLocation>Gianthold Tor, Black Dragon 's chest</DropLocation>
            <MinLevel>13</MinLevel>
            <EquipmentSlot>
